WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:12.580
When the Arctic Monkeys formed, none of them
could play a musical instrument.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:17.460
If you ate in a different New York eatery
every day for 12 years, you still wouldn't

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.269
have visited all of the city's restaurants.

00:00:20.269 --> 00:00:24.490
Lizards can't breathe and walk at the same
time.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:30.580
Coyotes in the US have learnt how traffic
lights work so they can cross the road safely.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:35.950
The world's largest container ships can carry
746 million bananas.

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:40.750
A quarter of American couples sleep in separate
beds.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:44.340
90% of all jellyfish are smaller than a human
thumbnail.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.340
Only two countries have not ratified the UN
Convention on the Rights of the Child: Somalia

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:46.340
and the US.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:52.010
John Montagu the 11th and current Earl of
Sandwich runs a chain of sandwich shops called

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.760
Earl of Sandwich.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:59.170
Drinking wine before a meal makes you eat
25% more.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:04.140
The place where Hitler killed himself is now
a children's playground.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:10.100
Barry Manilow's No. 1 hit 'I Write the Songs'
wasn't written by Barry Manilow.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:15.720
In 2002, the US military developed a sandwich
that stays fresh for three years.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:21.600
On 28 June 2009, Stephen Hawking hosted a
party for time travellers from the future.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.430
Nobody showed up.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:27.440
New Zealand has an official National Wizard.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:34.479
In wine-tasting, a 'cat pee aroma' is a compliment.

